---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Contact Policy">
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-gray-950 py-20 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Contact & Communication Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mb-8">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</p>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. Contact Methods</h2>
          <p>
            You can contact WebBuild by CraftandCode through the following methods:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-gray-900 rounded border border-gray-800">
            <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@craftandcode.com" class="text-indigo-400 hover:text-indigo-300">hello@craftandcode.com</a></p>
            <p><strong>Contact Form:</strong> Available on our website's Contact section</p>
            <p><strong>Service Area:</strong> North Carolina & Nationwide Delivery</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">2. Response Times</h2>
          <p>
            We aim to respond to all inquiries within 24-48 business hours. Response times may vary depending on the complexity of your inquiry and current workload. Emergency inquiries should be clearly marked as such in your initial contact.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">3. Email Communications</h2>
          <p>
            By providing your email address, you consent to receive communications from us regarding:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 mt-3">
            <li>Responses to your inquiries</li>
            <li>Project updates and status reports</li>
            <li>Service notifications (with your consent)</li>
            <li>Marketing and promotional materials (which you may opt-out from at any time)</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">4. Opting Out</h2>
          <p>
            You can unsubscribe from marketing and promotional emails at any time by clicking the "Unsubscribe" link at the bottom of any email we send. However, we will continue to send you transactional emails related to your project or inquiry.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">5. Confidentiality</h2>
          <p>
            All communications and information shared during the inquiry and project process will be kept confidential in accordance with our Privacy Policy. We do not share your personal information with third parties without your explicit consent.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">6. Communication Preferences</h2>
          <p>
            During the project consultation, we will discuss your preferred communication methods and frequency. We respect your communication preferences and will honor them throughout our engagement.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">7. Spam and Abuse</h2>
          <p>
            We reserve the right to report and take action against any abusive, threatening, or spam communications. Misuse of our contact methods may result in permanent blocking of future communications.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">8. Do Not Track</h2>
          <p>
            If your browser or service supports "Do Not Track" signals, we will honor those preferences and will not use tracking technologies on your visits to our website.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">9. Service Availability Notice</h2>
          <p>
            WebBuild operates on a limited schedule. We typically respond to inquiries during regular business hours. For time-sensitive matters, please indicate the urgency in your initial contact.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">10. Contact Policy Changes</h2>
          <p>
            We may update this Contact Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last updated" date.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mt-10 p-6 bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/30 rounded">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Ready to Start Your Project?</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Get in touch with WebBuild by CraftandCode today. We're here to help elevate your digital presence.
          </p>
          <a href="#contact" class="inline-block px-6 py-2 bg-indigo-500 hover:bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded transition-colors">
            Begin Your Project
          </a>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
